# Central Rule Index (VoltPulse)

## Rule files

| File | Scope | Always |
|------|-------|--------|
| `10-common-project-standards.mdc` | All code | Yes |
| `20-sdd-workflow.mdc` | Plans, cards, evidence, docs updates | Yes |
| `30-anti-leak.mdc` | Branding, naming, IP boundary | Yes |
| `40-parallel-worktrees.mdc` | Subagents, worktrees, split work | Yes |
| `50-pr-review.mdc` | PR / branch review | On review asks |
| `60-memory-elephant-goldfish.mdc` | What pins vs local-notes | Yes |
| `70-tooling-rtk-caveman.mdc` | rtk / caveman / graphify | Yes |
| `caveman.mdc` | Terse agent prose | Yes |
| `graphify.mdc` | If present after `graphify cursor install` | Yes |

## Precedence (high → low)

1. **Anti-leak / security** — no proprietary paste, no secrets, VoltPulse brand only
2. **Architecture freeze** — planes/services/contracts in `docs/`; features phase, arch does not redesign
3. **Correctness + contracts** — OpenAPI / `vp.*` events / acceptance criteria
4. **Evidence + tests** — card done needs proof
5. **Maintainability** — modularity, DRY within VoltPulse names
6. **Style** — naming, formatting

## Non-negotiables

- No hardcoded secrets / hosts / role IDs — config/env only.
- No silent `catch` — rethrow, typed error, or log + typed response.
- No proprietary code/contracts/topics/UI chrome copy.
- Right-sized delivery — match card acceptance; no underbuild/overbuild.
- Formal docs only in `docs/`; discussion in `local-notes/` (gitignored).

## How to load context

1. Read this index + `AGENTS.md`.
2. Load card’s listed docs only — not whole repo.
3. Load matching domain rules when code exists under `apps/*`.
4. Never dump `local-notes/` into commits or PRs.
